I&#39;m sure my BK nature is due in part to the 5 or 6 years I was away from my gaming group. My gaming in that time was much more focused on tabletop wargames (Warmachine and Infinity, mostly) and various computer games (WoW, for the most part).

&nbsp;

I&#39;ve been back with my RP group for about 5 years now, but I&#39;m still very much focused on effectiveness in combat. In D&amp;D or Pathfinder, give me a barbarian or sorceror. In my Only War (WH40K Imperial Guard RPG) game, I&#39;m playing an Ogryn. In Legend of the Five Rings, I&#39;m Crab Clan all the way. If it&#39;s big and hits things, or makes things disappear in explosions or a hail of bullets, I&#39;ve probably tried playing it at some time in some game or other.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

I&#39;ll have to show this quiz to my gaming group just to see what sort of gamers we are. Could be very amusing - or frightening.&nbsp;
